OL,3,CErling Haaland unveils dramatic new
OL,4,Chaircut for first Man City game
OL,6,FNorwegian footballer Erling Haaland
OL,7,Fhas undergone a dramatic new haircut
OL,8,Fas he prepares for another Premier
OL,9,FLeague season with Manchester City.
OL,11,FThe striker, known for his long blonde
OL,12,Fhair, took to social media to reveal a
OL,13,Fnew closely-cropped look on Sunday,
OL,14,Ftelling football fans: "New season,
OL,15,Fnew trim."
OL,17,FIn a video of the cut uploaded to his
OL,18,FYouTube account, Haaland said he had
OL,19,Fthought about changing his hair
OL,20,Fimmediately after the 2026 men's World
OL,21,FCup, but hadn't found time.
