PN,31202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F312A1787681944
OL,3,CErling Haaland unveils dramatic new
OL,4,Chaircut for first Man City game
OL,6,F"The new season starts now, so it's
OL,7,Ftime to get a fresh start and
OL,8,Feverything," Haaland, 26, said.
OL,10,F"The only thing is, Zlatan
OL,11,F(Ibrahimovic) told me never cut your
OL,12,Fhair because your strength is in your
OL,13,Fhair. I'm a bit nervous."
OL,15,FHaaland emerged as one of the biggest
OL,16,Fsocial media stars of the World Cup,
OL,17,Fscoring seven goals for Norway and
OL,18,Fgaining more than 32 million Instagram
OL,19,Ffollowers during the tournament - the
OL,20,Fmost growth of any player.
OL,26,@sD@Lrq
