PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F312A1787681944
OL,3,CErling Haaland unveils dramatic new
OL,4,Chaircut for first Man City game
OL,6,FMany TikTok users delighted in posting
OL,7,Fabout the footballer's long hair, on-
OL,8,Fpitch celebrations and close
OL,9,Ffriendship with England's Jude
OL,10,FBellingham.
OL,12,FHaaland could be seen FaceTiming
OL,13,FIbrahimovic shortly after his haircut,
OL,14,Fas well as his Man City teammate Jack
OL,15,FGrealish and former manager Pep
OL,16,FGuardiola.
OL,18,FIbrahimovic asked him: "What is this?
OL,19,FYou lost a bet or what?" before
OL,20,Fjoking: "Block me and erase my number."
